<title>INDIA: TABLE - India's RBI repo auctions calendar.</title>
<headline>TABLE - India's RBI repo auctions calendar.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Thursday  announced the schedule for securities repurchase auctions in July.</p>
<p>The repo auctions will be open to parties holding SGL account and  current account with the RBI.</p>
<p>The following are the details of the auction</p>
<p>Date of auction  Date of payment   Period  Repurchase date</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>August 4, 1997    August  5, 1997    3 days    August 8, 1997</p>
<p>August 7	    August  8	    4 days    August 12</p>
<p>August 11	   August  12	   4 days    August 16</p>
<p>August 14	   August  16	   3 days    August 19</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
